@startuml state_connection
title Firmware link state (Connected flag)

[*] --> Disconnected : setup(): all LEDs off

state Disconnected : Connected = false\nLEDs off\nno ControlPacket is sent
state Connected : Connected = true\ngreen LED on\nControlPacket sent every 25 ms

Disconnected --> Connected : valid packet received\n(handshake or telemetry)
Connected --> Connected : valid packet received\n(deadtimeOld = now)
Connected --> Disconnected : no valid packet for\nmore than 2000 ms (IDLETIMER)
@enduml
